title: The Fifth Comintern Congress
subtitle: June and July 1924. The International demands a party of cells.
new-page: true
tags: kpd_event
view-if: year = 1924 and month = 6 and civil_war = 0 and y24_bolshevisation_done = 0
on-arrival: y24_bolshevisation_done = 1

= Bolshevisation

The Fifth Congress of the Comintern meets in Moscow from mid-June. The International's leaders, Zinoviev above all, ask every section to become a "Bolshevik party": organised in factory cells, disciplined by the centre, and purged of the unfaithful. The German party's delegation is led by Ruth Fischer, who uses the occasion to denounce Trotsky.

A party so organised is better at holding meetings and passing resolutions than at arguing, which is the worst thing that a mass party in a pluralist country can lose.

- @accept: Accept bolshevisation in full.
- @adapt: Adopt the cell system but keep the old branches alive.
- @resist: Resist: the German party needs open discussion.

@accept
subtitle: Trust +8, Apparatus +6 strength, Centre +8 dissent.
on-arrival: comintern_trust += 8; kf_apparatus_strength += 6; kf_centre_dissent += 8; workers_kpd -= 1
go-to: root

The branches are broken up and the factory cells take their place. Discipline improves. The party's newspapers repeat Moscow's formulae and the old members who liked to argue go home. A party that tells its members what they think soon has members who have nothing to say.

@adapt
subtitle: Trust +3, Apparatus +3 strength.
on-arrival: comintern_trust += 3; kf_apparatus_strength += 3; kf_centre_strength += 2
go-to: root

We build the cells and keep the old branches for those who still prefer them. It is untidy, the apparatus calls it half-hearted, and the members, for once, are able to take part.

@resist
subtitle: Trust -8, Centre +5 strength, Apparatus +8 dissent.
on-arrival: comintern_trust -= 8; kf_centre_strength += 5; kf_apparatus_dissent += 8; moscow_divergence_pts += 2
go-to: root

We tell the Comintern that Germany is not Russia. Moscow takes note in writing. The Centre applauds, and the apparatus, which depends on Moscow for its standing, does not.
